---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Cyfraniad Ariannol" title_en="Financial Contribution">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Cyfraniad Ariannol</span><span lang="en">Financial Contribution</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Cyfraniad Ariannol</span><span lang="en">Financial Contribution</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Cyfraniad Ariannol y Cyngor i'r Gymuned</span><span lang="en">The Council's Financial Contribution to the Community</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn cyfrannu at fywyd y gymuned drwy ei wariant ar wasanaethau a grantiau lleol. Mae hyn yn cynnwys cymorth i grwpiau gwirfoddol, cynnal mannau cyhoeddus, a gweithgareddau cymunedol.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council contributes to community life through its spending on services and local grants. This includes support for voluntary groups, maintaining public spaces, and community activities.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Meysydd gwariant nodweddiadol</span><span lang="en">Typical areas of expenditure</span></h3>
    <ul lang="cy">
      <li>Grantiau i grwpiau a sefydliadau cymunedol lleol</li>
      <li>Cynnal a chadw mynwentydd a mannau agored</li>
      <li>Cyfraniad at wasanaethau lleol</li>
      <li>Costau gweinyddol y cyngor</li>
      <li>Hyfforddiant a datblygiad cynghorwyr</li>
    </ul>
    <ul lang="en">
      <li>Grants to local community groups and organisations</li>
      <li>Maintenance of cemeteries and open spaces</li>
      <li>Contribution to local services</li>
      <li>Council administrative costs</li>
      <li>Councillor training and development</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Grantiau</span><span lang="en">Grants</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae'r cyngor yn cynnig grantiau i grwpiau cymunedol ac elusennau lleol. Gweler y dudalen grantiau am fanylion.</p>
    <p lang="en">The council offers grants to community groups and local charities. See the grants page for details.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="/the-council/grants/"><span lang="cy">Grantiau →</span><span lang="en">Grants →</span></a>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      <a href="/the-council/what-we-spend/"><span lang="cy">Beth rydym yn ei wario →</span><span lang="en">What we spend →</span></a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
